"1) Mundarija eski sarlavhani ko‘rsatmoqda","2) Faqat bitta bo‘lim Landscape bo‘lsin","3) Ro‘yxat qayta boshlanishi kerak","4) Birinchi sahifa kolontituli boshqacha bo‘lsin","A) Different First Page","B) Restart at 1","C) Update entire table","D) Section Break"]},{"code":"M03-S26-W03-04","chapter":"W03","format":"Y3","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Wordda Excel ro‘yxatidan foydalanib xatosiz shaxsiylashtirilgan sertifikatlar yaratish uchun quyidagi amallarni mantiqan bog‘liq ketma-ketlikda joylang.","explanation_md":"Ma’lumot manbasi biriktirilgach ustunlarga mos Merge Field maydonlari ishlaydi; yakuniy yaratishdan avval natija tekshiriladi.","source_reference":"ICT 5 (2020), matnli hujjatlar, PDF 49–67; Cambridge 9, 14/17-bob; 13.04.2026 PDF 17-bet (ko‘rinish bo‘yicha moslashtirish); 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["Merge Field maydonlarini qo‘yish","Excel ma’lumotlar manbasini tanlash","Preview Results bilan qiymatlarni nazorat qilish","Finish & Merge orqali yakuniy hujjatlarni yaratish"],"order":[2,1,3,4],"options":["1) Merge Field maydonlarini qo‘yish","2) Excel ma’lumotlar manbasini tanlash","3) Preview Results bilan qiymatlarni nazorat qilish","4) Finish & Merge orqali yakuniy hujjatlarni yaratish"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-01","chapter":"E02","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Excelda D5 katakka `=$B$1+$A2*B2` yozilgan. Uni C6 ga ko‘chirganda formuladagi havolalar qanday bo‘ladi va qiymat nechaga teng? A1:C3 da A3=4, B1=0, B2=7, A2=−2, C3=8.","explanation_md":"D5→C6 da ustun siljishi −1, satr +1. $B$1 o‘zgarmaydi, $A2→$A3, B2→A3. 0+4×4=16.","source_reference":"Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11-bet (jadval, D5→C6 aralash havola, hisob natijasi); Cambridge 9, 20-bob","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["`=$B$1+$A3*A3`, natija 16","`=$B$1+$A2*B2`, natija −14","`=$A$1+$A3*A3`, natija 16","`=$B$2+$A3*A3`, natija 23"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-02","chapter":"E02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Excelda E4 katakka `=C$2*$D3+$B$1` yozilgan. F6 ga nusxalansa, yangi formula qaysi?","explanation_md":"E4→F6: ustun +1, satr +2; C$2→D$2; $D3→$D5; $B$1 mutlaq qoladi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["`=D$2*$D5+$C$3`","`=D$2*$D5+$B$1`","`=D$4*$E5+$B$1`","`=C$2*$D3+$B$1`"],"answer_index":1},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-03","chapter":"E02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"D4 katakda `=$B$2+A3*C$1` bor. Uni F7 katakka nusxalash kerak. F7 formulasini toping.","explanation_md":"D4→F7: ustun +2, satr +3; A3→C6; C$1→E$1; $B$2 o‘zgarmaydi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["`=$B$2+A3*C$1`","`=$B$2+C3*E$1`","`=$B$2+C6*E$1`","`=$D$5+C6*E$4`"],"answer_index":2},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-04","chapter":"E02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"A1=12, B1=0. C1 katakdagi `=IFERROR(A1/B1,\"XATO\")` nimani qaytaradi?","explanation_md":"A1/B1 nolga bo‘linadi, lekin IFERROR ikkinchi argumentdagi `XATO` matnini qaytaradi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["0 sonini","`#DIV/0!`ni bevosita","12 sonini","`XATO` matnini"],"answer_index":3},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-05","chapter":"E02","format":"Y1","difficulty":3,"stem_md":"Excel formulasida `=SUM(A1:A5` yozilgan va yakuniy qavs qo‘yilmagan. Quyidagi fikrlarning qaysi biri eng aniq?","explanation_md":"Sintaktik qavs yetishmaydi; #REF! esa odatda yaroqsiz katak havolasi bilan bog‘liq.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Bu xatolik qavs jufti yetishmasligi bilan bog‘liq; Excel formulani to‘g‘rilashni taklif qilishi mumkin","Bu har doim #REF! xatosini keltiradi","Bu formula baribir barcha versiyalarda majburiy to‘g‘ri","Bu avtomatik 5 ga ko‘paytirish deb talqin qilinadi"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-01","chapter":"E03","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"A1:A5 kataklarda 12, bo‘sh, \"Baho\", 0 va 8 yozilgan. `=COUNTA(A1:A5)-COUNT(A1:A5)` natija?","explanation_md":"COUNTA=4 (12, matn, 0, 8), COUNT=3 (12, 0, 8); farq 1.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["0","1","2","3"],"answer_index":1},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-02","chapter":"E03","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"A2:A6 da sinf nomlari: A, B, A, A, B. B2:B6 da ballar: 4, 6, 9, 2, 8. `=SUMIF(A2:A6,\"A\",B2:B6)-COUNTIF(A2:A6,\"A\")` natijasi?","explanation_md":"A guruhi bo‘yicha balllar 4+9+2=15, COUNTIF=3; 15−3=12.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["9","11","12","15"],"answer_index":2},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-03","chapter":"E03","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Excelda quyidagi baholar jadvali bor: A2:B4 = (40,2), (60,3), (80,5). D2=60. `=VLOOKUP(D2,A2:B4,2,FALSE)` qanday qiymat qaytaradi?","explanation_md":"FALSE aynan 60 ni qidiradi va shu satrning 2-ustunidagi 3 qiymatini oladi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["2","5","`#N/A`","3"],"answer_index":3},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-04","chapter":"E03","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"A1:A4 qiymatlar: 5, 0, \"Test\", 10. `=IF(COUNT(A1:A4)=3,AVERAGE(A1:A4),-1)` natija?","explanation_md":"COUNT=3 (matn e’tiborga olinmaydi), AVERAGE=(5+0+10)/3=5.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["5","3.75","-1","15"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-05","chapter":"E03","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"A1=7, B1=−9. Excelda `=IF(AND(A1>0,B1<0),ABS(B1)+A1,0)` qiymat nechaga teng?","explanation_md":"Ikkala shart rost, ABS(−9)+7=16.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["0","16","2","9"],"answer_index":1},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-01","chapter":"E04","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Filtrdan so‘ng jadvalda faqat balli kamida 70 va tumani “Navoiy” bo‘lganlar ko‘rinsin. Qaysi shart to‘g‘ri?","explanation_md":"Ikkala talab bir vaqtda bajarilishi shart; Sort filtr o‘rnini bosmaydi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Ball < 70 AND Tuman = Navoiy","Faqat ballni kamayish tartibida Sort qilish","Ball ≥ 70 AND Tuman = Navoiy","Ball ≥ 70 OR Tuman = Navoiy"],"answer_index":2},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-02","chapter":"E04","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Excelda A sinf 24, B sinf 36, C sinf 60 ta kitob to‘pladi. Jami bo‘yicha doiraviy diagrammada C sinf ulushi qanchaga teng?","explanation_md":"Jami 24+36+60=120; C sinf ulushi 60/120=50%. Diagrammadagi nisbiy ulush masalasi.","source_reference":"Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 12-bet (ustunli jadvaldan doiraviy ulushga o‘tish); Cambridge 9, 16-bob","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["60%","33%","25%","50%"],"answer_index":3},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-03","chapter":"E04","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Jadval: (Nomi, Fan, Ball) = (Ali, Informatika, 87), (Sami, Matematika, 79), (Olim, Informatika, 65), (Zebo, Informatika, 92). Fan=Informatika VA Ball≥80 filtri nechta satr ko‘rsatadi?","explanation_md":"Ali va Zebo ikki shartni ham qanoatlantiradi; Olimda ball yetmaydi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["2","3","1","4"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-04","chapter":"E04","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Ustunli diagrammada uch filial savdosi A=80, B=120, C=100. Agar har birining soni 20 tadan oshsa, qaysi fikr o‘zgarmaydi?","explanation_md":"Hamma ustunga bir xil 20 qo‘shilganda ayirmalar saqlanadi va tartib ham o‘zgarmaydi; ulush, yig‘indi va qiymatlar o‘zgaradi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["B filialning mutlaq savdo hajmi","Filiallar orasidagi absolyut farq va kamayish tartibi","Ularning umumiy yig‘indisi","A filialning jami savdodagi foiz ulushi"],"answer_index":1},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-06","chapter":"E02","format":"Y2","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Excel xatolik kodlarini sabab bilan moslang. Bu savolda xatoliklar alohida, o‘zaro farqli holatlar sifatida berilgan.","explanation_md":"1–C, 2–D, 3–B, 4–A. 13-apreldagi xatoliklar moslashtirishiga o‘xshash; manbadagi izohlar tekshirilgan va aniq vaziyatlarga almashtirilgan.","source_reference":"13.04.2026 Attestatsiya PDF 20-bet (Excel xatolik kodlari); Cambridge 9, 20-bob","review_note":"","status":"review","left":["#DIV/0!","#REF!","#NAME?","#VALUE!"],"right":["Noto‘g‘ri turdagi matnni hisoblashga qo‘shish","Formula nomi noto‘g‘ri yozilgan","Nolga bo‘lish","O‘chirilgan katakka yaroqsiz havola"],"mapping":{"1":3,"2":4,"3":2,"4":1},"options":["1) #DIV/0!","2) #REF!","3) #NAME?","4) #VALUE!","A) Noto‘g‘ri turdagi matnni hisoblashga qo‘shish","B) Formula nomi noto‘g‘ri yozilgan","C) Nolga bo‘lish","D) O‘chirilgan katakka yaroqsiz havola"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-06","chapter":"E03","format":"Y2","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Funksiya va natijani moslang. A1:A4 = {5; 0; \"T\"; 15}; B1=6.","explanation_md":"COUNT=3; COUNTA=4; MAX=15; SUM=20+6=26.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","left":["COUNT(A1:A4)","COUNTA(A1:A4)","MAX(A1:A4)","SUM(A1:A4)+B1"],"right":["26","4","15","3"],"mapping":{"1":4,"2":2,"3":3,"4":1},"options":["1) COUNT(A1:A4)","2) COUNTA(A1:A4)","3) MAX(A1:A4)","4) SUM(A1:A4)+B1","A) 26","B) 4","C) 15","D) 3"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-05","chapter":"E04","format":"Y2","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Excel diagrammalarining vazifalari bilan moslang.","explanation_md":"Column–B, Line–C, Pie–D, Scatter–A. Demo 2026 diagramma talqini shakliga asoslangan yangi moslashtirish.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","left":["Column","Line","Pie","Scatter (XY)"],"right":["Ikki sonli o‘zgaruvchi orasidagi tarqoqlikni ko‘rsatish","Toifalar qiymatlarini yonma-yon qiyoslash","Vaqt bo‘yicha yo‘nalishni ko‘rsatish","Bitta butunning qismlari ulushini ifodalash"],"mapping":{"1":2,"2":3,"3":4,"4":1},"options":["1) Column","2) Line","3) Pie","4) Scatter (XY)","A) Ikki sonli o‘zgaruvchi orasidagi tarqoqlikni ko‘rsatish","B) Toifalar qiymatlarini yonma-yon qiyoslash","C) Vaqt bo‘yicha yo‘nalishni ko‘rsatish","D) Bitta butunning qismlari ulushini ifodalash"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E02-07","chapter":"E02","format":"Y3","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"E4 katakdagi formulani G6 ga ko‘chirishda havolalarni hisoblash jarayoni bosqichlarini mantiqiy tartibga keltiring.","explanation_md":"Avval manzillar xususiyati va siljish aniqlanadi, keyin havolalar qayta hisoblanadi, so‘ng yakuniy formula nazorat qilinadi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["Mutlaq qismlarni o‘zgarishsiz qoldirib aralash/nisbiy qismlarga siljishni qo‘llash","E4→G6 uchun ustun +2, satr +2 siljishni hisoblash","Yakuniy formulani tuzish va sintaksisini tekshirish","Boshlang‘ich formuladagi har bir havolaning $ bilan mahkamlangan qismlarini belgilash"],"order":[4,2,1,3],"options":["1) Mutlaq qismlarni o‘zgarishsiz qoldirib aralash/nisbiy qismlarga siljishni qo‘llash","2) E4→G6 uchun ustun +2, satr +2 siljishni hisoblash","3) Yakuniy formulani tuzish va sintaksisini tekshirish","4) Boshlang‘ich formuladagi har bir havolaning $ bilan mahkamlangan qismlarini belgilash"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E03-07","chapter":"E03","format":"Y3","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Tekshirilgan (aniq moslikli) VLOOKUP qidiruv formulasini tuzish ish tartibini berilgan bosqichlardan yig‘ing.","explanation_md":"Kalit, diapazon va qaytish ustuni indeksini aniqlamasdan, aniq moslikli to‘liq formula tuzib bo‘lmaydi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["Jadvaldagi qaytariladigan ustunning tartib raqamini belgilash","Qidiriladigan kalit joylashgan katakni ko‘rsatish","Manba jadval diapazonini belgilash","`VLOOKUP(kalit,diapazon,ustun,FALSE)` formulasini yakunlash"],"order":[2,3,1,4],"options":["1) Jadvaldagi qaytariladigan ustunning tartib raqamini belgilash","2) Qidiriladigan kalit joylashgan katakni ko‘rsatish","3) Manba jadval diapazonini belgilash","4) `VLOOKUP(kalit,diapazon,ustun,FALSE)` formulasini yakunlash"]},{"code":"M03-S26-E04-06","chapter":"E04","format":"Y3","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Faqat “Informatika” fanidan 70 balldan yuqori natijalarni diagrammada ko‘rsatishning quyidagi amallarini tartiblang. Amal o‘rni yakuniy, tekshiriladigan natijaga tayanadi.","explanation_md":"Avval ma’lumot va mezon tekshiriladi, keyin filtrlanadi; diagramma shu ko‘rinadigan yozuvlarga tayangan holda quriladi.","source_reference":"Cambridge 9, 20-bob (ma’lumot tahlili); Cambridge 10–11, 8-bob; Demo 2026 10 000 PDF 11–12-bet (formula/diagramma); 13.04.2026 PDF 3,20-bet","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["Saralangan manbadan diagramma qurish","Ma’lumotlarning Fan va Ball ustunlarini tekshirish","Fan=Informatika hamda Ball>70 filtr shartini qo‘yish","Diagramma ustunlarini ko‘rinadigan natijalar bilan solishtirish"],"order":[2,3,1,4],"options":["1) Saralangan manbadan diagramma qurish","2) Ma’lumotlarning Fan va Ball ustunlarini tekshirish","3) Fan=Informatika hamda Ball>70 filtr shartini qo‘yish","4) Diagramma ustunlarini ko‘rinadigan natijalar bilan solishtirish"]},{"code":"M03-S26-P02-01","chapter":"P02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Bitta slaydda rasmga Entrance effekti, keyingi slaydga Fade o‘tish effekti berildi. Qaysi fikr to‘g‘ri?","explanation_md":"Animation va Transition turli darajadagi effektlar: obyekt ichida vs slaydlar orasida.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Entrance slayd ichidagi obyektga, Fade (Transition) esa slaydlar almashishiga tegishli","Har ikkisi faqat shriftda ishlaydi","Fade slaydni tahrirlashni o‘chiradi","Entrance faqat slaydlarni almashtiradi"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-P02-02","chapter":"P02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Animation Pane’da 1-effekt “On Click”, 2-effekt “With Previous”, 3-effekt “After Previous” qilib berilgan. Ikkinchi effekt qachon ishga tushadi?","explanation_md":"With Previous — oldingi effekt bilan birga boshlanadi; Delay alohida sozlama.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Faqat uchinchi marta bosilganda","Birinchi effekt bilan bir vaqtda","Uchinchi effektdan keyin","Slayd ochilganidan 10 daqiqa keyin"],"answer_index":1},{"code":"M03-S26-P01-01","chapter":"P01","format":"Y1","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Taqdimotdagi barcha 50 slaydning sarlavha shriftini bir xil o‘zgartirish talab etildi. Qo‘lda har bir slaydni o‘zgartirmaslik uchun qaysi vosita afzal?","explanation_md":"Slide Master umumiy slayd maketi va dizayn elementlarini boshqarishga xizmat qiladi.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Presenter View","Rehearse Timings","Slide Master","Animation Pane"],"answer_index":2},{"code":"M03-S26-P01-02","chapter":"P01","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Taqdimotga video qo‘shilgandan keyin uni avtomatik boshlash va faqat slayd ichida ko‘rsatish kerak. Qaysi juft sozlama muhim?","explanation_md":"Video ishga tushirish xulqi Playbackda belgilanadi; ko‘rinish slayd ichidagi obyekt xossasi bilan boshqariladi.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Transitions → Duration va Page Margins","Review → Track Changes va Compare","Insert → Table va Word Count","Playback → Start Automatically va video o‘lchami/joylashuvini tekshirish"],"answer_index":3},{"code":"M03-S26-P02-03","chapter":"P02","format":"Y1","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"O‘qituvchi 12 slaydli taqdimotni har safar 15 soniyadan keyin avtomatik almashtirmoqchi. Qaysi sozlama mos?","explanation_md":"Automatic slayd o‘tishi Advance Slide / After maydoni orqali sozlanadi; bosish bilan o‘tish alohida yoqilishi mumkin.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","options":["Transitions → Advance Slide → After: 00:15 (zarur slaydlarda)","Animations → Emphasis → Spin","Insert → Symbols → Equation","Home → Replace → All"],"answer_index":0},{"code":"M03-S26-P02-04","chapter":"P02","format":"Y2","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Animatsiya boshlanish turlari va bajarilish shartlarini moslang.","explanation_md":"1–C, 2–D, 3–A, 4–B; Delay alohida maydon va bu uch start turini almashtirmaydi.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","left":["On Click","With Previous","After Previous","Duration"],"right":["Oldingi effekt tugagach ishga tushish","Bajarilish qancha vaqt davom etishini belgilash","Sichqoncha bosilganda boshlash","Oldingi effekt bilan birga boshlash"],"mapping":{"1":3,"2":4,"3":1,"4":2},"options":["1) On Click","2) With Previous","3) After Previous","4) Duration","A) Oldingi effekt tugagach ishga tushish","B) Bajarilish qancha vaqt davom etishini belgilash","C) Sichqoncha bosilganda boshlash","D) Oldingi effekt bilan birga boshlash"]},{"code":"M03-S26-P01-03","chapter":"P01","format":"Y3","difficulty":4,"stem_md":"Tayyor shablon asosida maktab konferensiyasi uchun bir xil ko‘rinishli 12 ta slayd yaratish ish tartibini bog‘liq bosqichlarda joylashtiring.","explanation_md":"Avval umumiy dizayn tanlanadi, keyin maket sozlanadi, mazmun kiritiladi, oxirida ko‘rsatishdagi moslik tekshiriladi.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["Master maketi va shriftlarni bir xillashtirish","Mavzu va auditoriyaga mos Theme tanlash","Slaydlarni kerakli layoutlar bilan to‘ldirish","Slide Show rejimida barcha slaydlarning mosligini tekshirish"],"order":[2,1,3,4],"options":["1) Master maketi va shriftlarni bir xillashtirish","2) Mavzu va auditoriyaga mos Theme tanlash","3) Slaydlarni kerakli layoutlar bilan to‘ldirish","4) Slide Show rejimida barcha slaydlarning mosligini tekshirish"]},{"code":"M03-S26-P02-05","chapter":"P02","format":"Y3","difficulty":5,"stem_md":"Rasmda birinchi effekt foydalanuvchi bosganda, ikkinchisi u bilan birga, uchinchisi ikkinchi effekt tugagach boshlanishi kerak. Bajariladigan sozlashlarni tartiblang.","explanation_md":"Avval ro‘yxatdagi tartib aniqlanadi; keyin start xususiyatlari 1=On Click, 2=With Previous, 3=After Previous qilib belgilanadi.","source_reference":"ICT 6 (2021), PDF 129–155; Cambridge 9, 19-bob; 2026 spesifikatsiya PDF 3","review_note":"","status":"review","steps":["3-effektni After Previous qilish","1-effekt uchun On Click tanlash","Animation Pane’da 1-, 2-, 3-effektlarni shu tartibda joylashtirish","2-effektni With Previous qilish"],"order":[3,2,4,1],"options":["1) 3-effektni After Previous qilish","2) 1-effekt uchun On Click tanlash","3) Animation Pane’da 1-, 2-, 3-effektlarni shu tartibda joylashtirish","4) 2-effektni With Previous qilish"]}]'::jsonb) LOOP
  code:=r->>'code';cha:=lower(r->>'chapter');fmt:=r->>'format';seed:='m03-task280:'||code;idq:=md5(seed||':q')::uuid;
  SELECT l0.id INTO l FROM public.lessons l0 JOIN public.modules m ON m.id=l0.module_id WHERE m.code='M03' AND l0.slug='office-v2-'||cha AND l0.status IN ('review'::public.content_status, 'published'::public.content_status) LIMIT 1;
  IF l IS NULL THEN RAISE NOTICE 'Skipping absent Office V2 source lesson: %',code;CONTINUE;END IF;
  cc:=CASE WHEN left(cha,1)='w' THEN 'S2.OFFICE.01' WHEN cha='e04' THEN 'S2.OFFICE.03' WHEN left(cha,1)='e' THEN 'S2.OFFICE.02' ELSE 'S2.OFFICE.04' END;
  SELECT ctr.id INTO c FROM public.constructs ctr WHERE ctr.code=cc AND ctr.is_active=true LIMIT 1;
  IF c IS NULL THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Missing construct %',cc;END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.questions WHERE id=idq) THEN
    IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.questions WHERE id=idq AND status='review' AND source_reference LIKE 'M03_STYLE_QA_2026|'||code||'|%') THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Collision: %',code;END IF;
    CONTINUE;
  END IF;
  INSERT INTO public.questions(id,subject_id,construct_id,group_code,format,cognitive,difficulty,stem_md,assets,is_generated,status,source_reference,source_lesson_id)
   VALUES(idq,s,c,'S2.OFFICE',fmt::public.question_format,(CASE WHEN (r->>'difficulty')::int=5 THEN 'mulohaza' ELSE 'qollash' END)::public.cognitive_level,(r->>'difficulty')::int,r->>'stem_md','[]'::jsonb,true,'review'::public.content_status,'M03_STYLE_QA_2026|'||code||'|'||(r->>'source_reference'),l);
  IF fmt='Y1' THEN
    FOR j IN 0..3 LOOP INSERT INTO public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md) VALUES(md5(seed||':a:'||j)::uuid,idq,'a',j,r->'options'->>j);END LOOP;
    payload:=jsonb_build_object('correct_option_id',(md5(seed||':a:'||(r->>'answer_index'))::uuid)::text);
  ELSIF fmt='Y2' THEN
    FOR j IN 0..3 LOOP
      INSERT INTO public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md) VALUES(md5(seed||':a:'||j)::uuid,idq,'a',j,r->'left'->>j);
      INSERT INTO public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md) VALUES(md5(seed||':b:'||j)::uuid,idq,'b',j,r->'right'->>j);
    END LOOP;
    pairs:='{}'::jsonb;
    FOR j IN 1..4 LOOP k:=(r->'mapping'->>j::text)::int-1;IF k NOT BETWEEN 0 AND 3 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Bad matching %',code;END IF;
      pairs:=pairs||jsonb_build_object((md5(seed||':a:'||(j-1))::uuid)::text,(md5(seed||':b:'||k)::uuid)::text);
    END LOOP;
    payload:=jsonb_build_object('pairs',pairs);
  ELSIF fmt='Y3' THEN
    FOR j IN 0..3 LOOP INSERT INTO public.question_options(id,question_id,side,order_idx,content_md) VALUES(md5(seed||':a:'||j)::uuid,idq,'a',j,r->'steps'->>j);END LOOP;
    ord:='[]'::jsonb;
    FOR j IN 0..3 LOOP k:=(r->'order'->>j)::int-1;IF k NOT BETWEEN 0 AND 3 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Bad ordering %',code;END IF;
      ord:=ord||jsonb_build_array((md5(seed||':a:'||k)::uuid)::text);
    END LOOP;
    payload:=jsonb_build_object('order',ord);
  ELSE RAISE EXCEPTION 'Unsupported format: %',fmt;END IF;
  INSERT INTO public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md) VALUES(idq,payload,r->>'explanation_md');
 END LOOP;
END
$pilot$;
COMMIT;
